00:58:33.820 --> 00:58:39.040
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who has issued new orders for how I'm supposed to do the show from now on.

00:58:39.040 --> 00:58:41.970
<v Ida Hakkila>"Could you sound more, I don't know, like a dominatrix?"

00:58:41.970 --> 00:58:54.340
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life .

00:58:54.340 --> 00:58:59.340
